# Advanced photo merge.
photo_merge_advanced.projective = U linganisa nga mavhonele (zwi katela u rembuluwa)
photo_merge_advanced.cylindrical = Panorama ya silinda
photo_merge_advanced.deghost = Bvisani zwifanyiso zwa murunzi wa zwithu zwi tshimbilaho (tshinepe tsha u thoma ndi tsha u vhambedza)
photo_merge_advanced.focal = Vhulapfu ha focal (px) / vhuphara ha tshifanyiso (px)
photo_merge_advanced.masks = Mvelelo ya u sedza i shumisa masiki a dziḽeyara ane a nga dzudzanywa. Nangani masiki kha Dziḽeyara ni pennde u i khwinisa.
photo_merge_advanced.no_match = A hu na u linganisa hu fulufhedzeaho ho wanalaho. Shumisani zwinepe zwi re na zwidodombedzwa, zwi ṱanganaho nga maanḓa, zwi re na tshanduko ṱhukhu dza mavhonele.
photo_merge_advanced.invalid = Zwifanyiso zwa u thoma kana nzudzanyo dza u ṱanganisa a zwi shumi.
